{"title":"리부트 시스템","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=brom5g/hAd4Y7yxk8/yntK7AZ6zuYrB2ZK3LBPA0&filename=th3","synopsis":"서기 2036년,\n시공간과 차원이 급작스레 꼬이게 된다.\n\n그로 인한 '공간 균열'이 지구에 '몬스터'를 흘러들어오게 만든 것이다.\n몬스터로 인해 점점 황폐해지는 지구, 죽어가는 사람들...\n그들은 수많은 연구 끝에 새로운 차원을 찾아냈다.\n\n이 차원에는 게임처럼 '시스템'이 존재한다.\n\n만년 레벨 3에 머무르고 있는 주인공, 이민규.\n아카데미 입학 당시에는 천재라 불렸으나... 지금은 레벨업도 못하는 찌질이 취급을 당하고 있다.\n\n그런 그가 '절대자' 시스템을 만나고,\n\n인생이 완전히 달라졌다?!\n\n사랑하는 사람들을 지키기 위해 강해진\n돈귀신 민규의 먼치킨 행진기,\n즐겁게 감상해 주세요!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":88,"change":{"type":"down","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":175,"change":{"type":"down","amount":87}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":84,"change":{"type":"up","amount":91}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":17,"change":{"type":"up","amount":67}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":165,"change":{"type":"down","amount":148}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":28,"change":{"type":"up","amount":137}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":35,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":45,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":70,"change":{"type":"down","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":168,"change":{"type":"down","amount":98}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":31,"change":{"type":"up","amount":137}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":41,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":51,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":71,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":155,"change":{"type":"down","amount":84}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":181,"change":{"type":"down","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":140,"change":{"type":"up","amount":41}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":38,"change":{"type":"up","amount":102}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":60,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":75,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":83,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026